context:
DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/magic/redundancy_groups/{redundancy_group_id}
Deletes a redundancy group. Member tunnels are not deleted — their redundancy_group_id is cleared.
Required: account_id (path); redundancy_group_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/magic/redundancy_groups/{redundancy_group_id}
Gets details for a specific redundancy group, including full member tunnel data.
Required: account_id (path); redundancy_group_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/magic/redundancy_groups/{redundancy_group_id}
Replaces the name, description, and full set of members for an existing redundancy group.
Required: account_id (path); redundancy_group_id (path); body (body)
